Replay an explicit candidate revision even while the checkout is on the audit branch.

Usage:
  > verify.nu <repo> <evidence> <tools> <consumer_tools> <validation_tools> <extraction> 

Flags:
  -h, --help: Display the help message for this command

Command Type:
  > custom

Parameters:
  repo <string>
  evidence <string>
  tools <string>
  consumer_tools <string>
  validation_tools <string>
  extraction <string>

Input/output types:
  ╭───┬───────┬────────╮
  │ # │ input │ output │
  ├───┼───────┼────────┤
  │ 0 │ any   │ any    │
  ╰───┴───────┴────────╯


